Excited w/the cover for our agency client 
@rboomhower.bsky.social's bio "Wallace Terry: A Reporter's Journey from Selma to Saigon to 'Bloods'" (
@unmpress.bsky.social, 10/26). In 1984, Terry pub'd "Bloods: An Oral History of the Vietnam War" as told to him by Black vets, a landmark book. #Booksky

